B.c_j=new A.fI(B.Tl,"Birthday Celebration & 1-Tap Wi-Fi Password Copy","Celebrate your special day with festive greetings and copy the high-speed study Wi-Fi password with a single tap directly from your dashboard.","Student Delight","cake","/student/home","View Dashboard")
